You are building the orchestration bot and database backend for $PULSE 
— a Solana memecoin launching on pump.fun with reactive treasury 
mechanics. Your job is the bot that monitors trades, manages five 
treasury vaults, executes community-decided actions, and writes 
everything to Supabase for the dashboard to display.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PROJECT CONTEXT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The token itself is a vanilla pump.fun bonding-curve launch with 
authorities renounced — you are NOT writing a smart contract. The 
"reactivity" comes from your bot, which controls five fee-routing 
wallets configured via pump.fun's Creator Fee Sharing feature 
(Jan 2026 release).

You are NOT building the dashboard. You are building the bot that 
writes to Supabase; the dashboard reads from Supabase.

