CORE RESPONSIBILITIES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. MONITORING (continuous)
   - Express server on port 3001 listens for Helius webhook POSTs
   - On every $PULSE trade event:
     • Insert row into price_history
     • Insert row into trade_tape (last 500 retained)
     • Recompute trades_per_hour (rolling 60-min window)
     • Update holder_balances (incremental)
     • Update token_state (price, mcap, holder count, volume_24h, BPM)
     • Check tier — if changed, trigger executeTierTransition()
     • Check streaks — update or break for affected wallets
     • Check reinforcement window — log participation if active
   - Separate setInterval every 30s for state sync fallback
   - Both webhook and polling paths feed the same update functions

2. TIER MANAGEMENT
   When mcap crosses into a new tier:
     a) Insert into tier_history (irreversible)
     b) Execute snapshot of qualifying wallets
     c) Insert status flags (Pioneer / Believer / Conviction / 
        Ascendant) into wallet_status table
     d) Open new Treasury Decision vote (see Voting section)
     e) Update bot_config (enable defense at Tier 2, enable rewards 
        at Tier 3, etc.)
     f) Post tier crossing announcement to Twitter and Telegram
     g) Log to bot_activity with TIER_UNLOCK kind

3. DEFENSE BOT (only when bot_config.defense_enabled = true, 
   typically from Tier 2 onwards)
   - Every 60 seconds, query price_history for last 1 hour
   - Compute % change from oldest sample to newest
   - If change ≤ -25% AND no defense in last 2 hours:
     • Quote Jupiter for SOL → $PULSE swap
     • Build versioned transaction
     • Submit via Jito bundle (priority fee + tip)
     • Use 30% of Defense Vault balance
     • Insert into defense_log
     • Insert into bot_activity (DEFENSE kind)
     • Open a 30-min "reinforcement window" — any wallet that 
       buys during this window gets logged in reinforcement_log
     • Post to Twitter: "🛡️ Defense triggered. -X% drop. 
       Deployed Y SOL. Reinforcement window open for 30 min."
     • Post to Telegram

4. ACTIVE MARKET MAKER (Tier 2+ when bot_config.mm_enabled)
   - Maintains buy walls at -2%, -5%, -10% below current price 
     using Defense Vault funds
   - Maintains sell walls at +3%, +7%, +15% above current price 
     using held $PULSE inventory
   - Spreads of 1-2%
   - LP fees earned flow into Decision Vault
   - Public state displayed on dashboard (mm_state table 
     updated every 60s)
   - On large dump events, MM walls absorb naturally

5. VOLUME GENERATOR (Tier 0+ when bot_config.volume_gen_enabled)
   - Small bot trades at random intervals (every 10-30 min)
   - Trade size: 0.05 to 0.2 SOL
   - Purpose: chart liquidity for Dexscreener visibility
   - Funded from Operations Vault
   - Transparent — flagged in trade_tape as bot_initiated=true
   - Disclosed publicly on /transparency page

6. WEEKLY REWARDS (Tier 3+ only)
   - Cron: Sundays 00:00 UTC
   - Query all $PULSE holders via Helius getTokenAccounts
   - For each holder:
     • Look up first_seen_at from holder_balances
     • Compute hold_days
     • Apply hold-time multiplier
     • Apply tier-status multipliers (compound)
     • Apply reinforcement bonus (capped at +0.5x)
     • Apply tweet multiplier bonus if active
   - Filter: balance ≥ 100,000 AND hold_days ≥ 3
   - Compute weighted shares
   - Distribute Rewards Vault SOL proportionally
   - Batch send via versioned transactions (20 per tx, 
     parallelized)
   - Insert summary into bot_activity
   - Post recap to Twitter + Telegram

7. TREASURY DECISIONS (the killer feature)
   At each tier crossing:
   a) openVote() creates a new active_votes row with:
      - tier_id reference
      - vote_options array (configurable per tier, see below)
      - opens_at, closes_at (72 hours from now)
      - decision_pool_sol (snapshotted Decision Vault balance)
      - status = 'open'
   b) Vote collection via dashboard:
      - Holders sign a message with their wallet
      - Bot verifies signature
      - Inserts into vote_records with conviction_weight
   c) tallyVote() runs continuously while vote is open
   d) When closes_at reached:
      - Compute final tally weighted by Conviction Score
      - Set vote.status = 'closed', vote.winning_option = X
      - executeVote() deploys treasury per winning option
   e) Vote options per tier (configurable):
      Tier 1: ["Buy + Burn", "Hold & Compound"]
      Tier 2: ["Buy + Burn", "Reinforce MM", "Hold"]
      Tier 3: ["Buy + Burn", "Holder Airdrop", "Reinforce MM", 
               "Treasury Trade", "Pulse Wars", "Hold"]
      Tier 4: ["Buy + Burn", "Holder Airdrop", "Reinforce MM", 
               "Treasury Trade", "Pulse Wars", "Permanent Strategy"]

8. EXECUTION OF VOTE OUTCOMES
   Each vote option maps to an executor function:
   - Buy + Burn: Jupiter swap SOL → $PULSE → send to incinerator
   - Holder Airdrop: distribute proportionally to qualifying holders 
     weighted by Conviction Score (similar to weekly rewards but 
     larger)
   - Reinforce MM: deposit funds into Defense Vault, increasing 
     buy wall depth
   - Treasury Trade: deploy into a specific memecoin (team specifies 
     target before vote opens)
   - Pulse Wars: buy supply of a competing memecoin and burn it
   - Hold: do nothing, funds compound to next tier
   - All execution logged to bot_activity

9. PULSE STREAKS
   - Maintained per wallet in streaks table
   - On every trade affecting a wallet:
     • If balance dropped below their tier threshold → break streak
     • If balance still above threshold → increment streak day
   - Daily cron at 00:00 UTC: recalculate all active streaks
   - Top 10 active streaks exposed to dashboard

10. REINFORCEMENT TRACKING
    - When defense triggers, open reinforcement_window record 
      (30 min)
    - Any buy during that window for that wallet:
      • Insert into reinforcement_log
      • Increment wallet's reinforcement_count
      • Update conviction_bonus
    - Reinforcement bonus formula: +0.1x per reinforcement, 
      capped at +0.5x

11. VOLUME BOUNTIES
    - Bot opens bounties at intelligent moments (low volume 
      stretches, post-defense recovery)
    - Bounty types:
      a) "Next wallet to buy ≥X SOL gets Y SOL refund"
      b) "First wallet to hold ≥$50K for 24h gets +5x multiplier 
         this week"
      c) "First 5 buyers in next 10 min get bonus reinforcement 
         status"
    - Inserted into bounties table with conditions, expiry, 
      reward_sol
    - Dashboard displays active bounty
    - On condition met: execute reward, mark bounty as fulfilled

12. TWEET → MULTIPLIER SYSTEM
    - Holder submits tweet URL via dashboard endpoint
    - Bot verifies tweet via Twitter API: mentions $PULSE, 
      author follows project, posted in last 24h
    - Bot polls tweet engagement every hour
    - When tweet hits >100 likes: award +0.25x multiplier to 
      author's wallet for 7 days
    - Stored in tweet_multipliers table with expires_at
    - Dashboard shows pending and active bonuses per wallet

13. NOTIFICATIONS
    Twitter posts on:
      - Tier crossings (always)
      - Defense triggers (always, with reinforcement window 
        callout)
      - Vote opening (always, with options + countdown)
      - Vote closing / execution (always)
      - Weekly reward summary (always at Tier 3+)
      - Bounty opening + fulfillment (always)
      - Notable buys (>5 SOL single trade)
    Telegram (same events + every action regardless of size, 
    higher frequency)
    Dashboard updates: via Supabase Realtime (automatic from 
    bot_activity INSERTs)

