SAFETY & RELIABILITY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

- Hot wallet hard limit: max 5 SOL per single transaction
- Daily transaction value cap: MAX_DAILY_SOL_DEPLOYED env var, 
  default 50 SOL. Cumulative deploy across all action types. Bot 
  refuses execution and logs to bot_activity for manual review 
  if exceeded.
- bot_config.paused flag: bot polls every 30s, halts all action 
  loops if true (monitoring continues)
- All swaps: 2% slippage cap, "confirmed" commitment before 
  marking complete
- On RPC error: retry 3x with exponential backoff (1s, 3s, 9s), 
  then fallback to QuickNode
- Better Stack heartbeat ping every 60s; alert if missed
- All wallet private keys: encrypted env vars, never logged
- Idempotent action handlers: re-execution of same action 
  with same inputs is a no-op (dedup via tx_signature)

