DATABASE SCHEMA (Supabase Postgres)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Provide a migration SQL file: 
packages/db/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql

Tables required:

  token_state          (singleton, current snapshot)
  bot_config           (singleton, control plane)
  vaults               (5 rows, one per VaultKind)
  bot_activity         (append-only, drives live feed)
  price_history        (rolling 7 days, auto-pruned)
  trade_tape           (last 500 trades, rolling)
  holder_balances      (current state per wallet)
  holder_snapshots     (tier-crossing snapshots, historical)
  wallet_status        (Pioneer/Believer/Conviction/Ascendant flags)
  tier_history         (append-only, every tier crossing)
  defense_log          (cooldown tracker + history)
  reinforcement_log    (defense participation by wallet)
  streaks              (active streaks per wallet)
  active_votes         (currently open Treasury Decision)
  vote_records         (individual votes cast)
  vote_history         (closed votes archive)
  bounties             (active and historical)
  tweet_multipliers    (active Twitter bonuses)
  mm_state             (market maker state for dashboard display)

Required:
  - Enums: tier_enum, vault_kind_enum, activity_kind_enum, 
    vote_status_enum
  - UUID primary keys (gen_random_uuid()) except singletons
  - Singletons enforce id=1 with CHECK constraint
  - Indexes on all timestamp DESC columns
  - Indexes on (wallet) where relevant for fast lookups
  - Trigger to auto-prune price_history >7 days
  - Trigger to maintain trade_tape size ≤500
  - Row Level Security:
    • Public SELECT on: token_state, vaults, bot_activity, 
      holder_snapshots, tier_history, active_votes, vote_history, 
      bounties, wallet_status, streaks, mm_state, trade_tape
    • Private on: bot_config, price_history, defense_log, 
      tweet_multipliers (sensitive), vote_records (signature data)
  - Enable Supabase Realtime on: bot_activity, token_state, 
    vaults, tier_history, active_votes, trade_tape

